WEBVTT

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.150
I etch out today with my finger

00:00:58.150 --> 00:01:01.560
on the dusty hood of a car

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:05.030
As the rain shower passed over

00:01:05.030 --> 00:01:07.860
it vanished just like love

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:13.000
ls there something in your heart

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:15.100
you can't get rid of?

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:21.780
Beat your invisible wings

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:25.650
We'll fight back against the wind

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:28.480
that gusts at <i>us</i> so relentlessly

00:01:28.820 --> 00:01:31.890
We'll stand firm against it

00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:35.720
with steadfast emotion! Go!

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:42.630
We continue running on our way

00:01:42.630 --> 00:01:48.640
to a place promised, where sandstorms whirl

00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:51.770
Tonight is the night

00:01:52.270 --> 00:01:55.280
We're gonna make it through

00:01:55.760 --> 00:02:03.220
On to our destination

00:02:10.460 --> 00:02:12.430
Wait up!

00:02:12.430 --> 00:02:16.360
Leaving behind your newly appointed
partner is a terrible thing to do!

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:25.870
This is an impeachment hearing, Madame.

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:30.350
Name, Luis Gonzalez.

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:34.350
Charged with causing a twenty-five car
pileup while driving drunk.

00:02:34.350 --> 00:02:36.480
The sentence was one year of
imprisonment with hard labor.

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:38.850
Who is this guy anyway?

00:02:38.850 --> 00:02:41.120
Real name and age, unknown.

00:02:41.120 --> 00:02:43.120
Goes by the name "Mister."

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:46.230
He is a swindler, a thief, and a self-employed pirate,

00:02:46.230 --> 00:02:48.560
an outlaw who tries to come across as a nice guy.

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:50.630
He's a romantic egoist.

00:02:50.630 --> 00:02:53.690
Well, then, so...

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:56.730
He's a Coyote!

00:02:56.910 --> 00:03:01.610
Sending in the Twelve Sisters just to
capture a single Coyote, huh?

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:05.180
We'll have to pay off the politicians again.

00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:07.650
Let me remind you that all of us in
this Guild share a common fate.

00:03:07.650 --> 00:03:09.350
What are you hiding?

00:03:09.350 --> 00:03:13.250
I already said that this is an impeachment.

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:15.090
What are you hiding?

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:18.530
What have those damned Coyotes gotten a hold of?

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:23.530
Watson?

00:03:23.530 --> 00:03:26.970
Uh, actually, my name is Chelsea.

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:31.170
Do you know what the essential fact
hidden within those documents is?

00:03:31.170 --> 00:03:32.440
Huh?

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:36.480
Ah, well...

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:37.750
It's the prison term.

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:39.110
The prison term?

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:40.750
He was serving a one-year term.

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:44.250
If he had just laid low, he would have
been let out in ten more days.

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:45.880
Huh?!

00:03:46.350 --> 00:03:48.920
I don't know what his reasons may have been,

00:03:48.920 --> 00:03:51.720
but Mister is clearly facing some kind
of very pressing circumstances.

00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:58.030
A coup d'état, I take it?

00:03:58.030 --> 00:03:59.560
Why are you in such a hurry?

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:05.680
Episode 2 The Girl from the Pirate Hideout

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:04.570
<i>Seven days remain before the Federation...</i>

00:04:04.570 --> 00:04:06.340
<i>drops its photon annihilation bomb.</i>

00:04:06.340 --> 00:04:11.250
<i>The Graceland Liberation Forces continue to decline to
offer any formal statement indicating their surrender.</i>

00:04:11.710 --> 00:04:13.620
<i>If the bomb is dropped,</i>

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:17.070
<i>the planet of Graceland itself will
be wiped out of existence.</i>

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:19.230
<i>As public dissent intensifies...</i>

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:22.360
<i>Hey, all you swank folk out there
in this dump of a town!</i>

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:24.960
<i>Sorry to interrupt, but I'd like to
chew on your ears for a bit!</i>

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:29.260
<i>My name is Super Soul, and
what I like is rock 'n roll!</i>

00:04:29.260 --> 00:04:31.970
<i>What I hate is all the damn politicians!</i>

00:04:31.970 --> 00:04:34.670
<i>This broadcast is being brought to you
over an illegal frequency.</i>

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:37.540
<i>To put it simply, this is a pirate broadcast!
An airwave hijack!</i>

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:40.340
<i>I'm gonna fight those shameless broadcasters
airing their damn imperial announcements</i>

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:42.340
<i>with my rock power!</i>

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:43.590
Damn...

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:43.880
<i>Hell yeah!</i>

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:47.220
<i>First, I'll take my rolling
punk to a jumping finish! Peace!</i>

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:47.340
Jeez! 


00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:52.090
2 hours, 59 minutes and 30 seconds have passed.

00:04:52.090 --> 00:04:53.720
You've got 30 seconds left.

00:04:53.720 --> 00:04:56.090
You're distracting me. Keep quiet!

00:04:56.090 --> 00:04:57.060
10!

00:04:57.060 --> 00:04:58.160
9...

00:04:58.160 --> 00:04:59.060
8...

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:00.090
7...

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:01.000
6...

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.300
5...

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:03.330
4...

00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:04.000
3...

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:06.950
ALL RIGHT!

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:05.430
2...

00:05:06.970 --> 00:05:09.800
Ah, damn...

00:05:09.140 --> 00:05:10.790
I am done!

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:15.010
I'm tellin' ya not to underestimate
Master Katana's technique!

00:05:17.910 --> 00:05:18.750
Here!

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:20.150
Whoopee!

00:05:20.150 --> 00:05:23.140
A limited edition model put out by
Galactica Gadgets!

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:27.720
The little beauty is mine at last!

00:05:29.820 --> 00:05:31.390
We can head out anytime now.

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:32.760
All right!

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:35.790
There's one thing I have to apologize for.

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:41.370
About when I said that the young lady
wanted to talk to you...

00:05:41.370 --> 00:05:43.430
That was a lie.

00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:47.910
I figured.

00:05:48.140 --> 00:05:50.180
You were already on to me, huh?

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:53.480
You know we don't have any time left, right?

00:05:54.050 --> 00:05:58.510
Graceland will be blown to bits in just seven days.

00:05:59.190 --> 00:06:00.390
Jeez...

00:05:59.550 --> 00:06:00.590
Oh yeah!

00:06:00.390 --> 00:06:02.720
Damn it, will you get over it already?!

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:02.190
Woo-hoo, I did it!

00:06:02.190 --> 00:06:04.840
I'm the man!

00:06:02.720 --> 00:06:04.030
C'mon, get a move on!

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:05.510
Huh?

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:10.680
Planet Ku-rong

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:09.760
<i>A night has passed since Marciano's Twelve
Sisters made their attack on Sandvil Penitentiary.</i>

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:13.330
<i>The extent of the damage has become more apparent as time has passed.</i>

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:18.610
<i>The death toll is eight, with two hundred sixty-three
wounded and one missing.</i>

00:06:18.610 --> 00:06:21.810
<i>Authorities are scrambling to investigate the reasons
for the attack on Sandvil Penitentiary</i>

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:25.510
<i>as well as possible connections with the prisoners.</i>

00:06:25.850 --> 00:06:27.280
Cheers!

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:33.350
I'll tell ya what my prediction is.

00:06:33.350 --> 00:06:36.790
I say Mister's still hiding on Sandvil.

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:38.530
Ain't no doubt about it!

00:06:38.530 --> 00:06:40.600
I don't buy that.

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:43.060
Mister wouldn't act so stupid.

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:44.930
You don't get it, do ya?

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:48.100
He'll do what they least expect.
That's how Mister works!

00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:50.630
What've we got here?

00:06:51.170 --> 00:06:54.680
You think you're a Coyote yourself, eh, kid?

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:58.170
Well you got a hundred thousand light-years
to go before that!

00:06:58.780 --> 00:07:01.120
What was that?! C'mon!

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:02.480
You wanna go?! Come on!

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:07.880
What's the matter, kid?!

00:07:09.160 --> 00:07:11.320
Whaddya doing, ya bastard?!

00:07:13.730 --> 00:07:15.420
Sonnuva bitch!

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:20.030
Get 'em, boys!

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:24.000
You're on!

00:07:45.090 --> 00:07:48.460
I'm not putting up with anyone causing
crap in my establishment!

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:54.800
You might say it's yours, but the truth is
it's Mister's establishment!

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:02.080
Whoa, hey, easy now!

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:06.350
Say, little lady, haven't you heard
anything from Mister yet?

00:08:06.350 --> 00:08:08.980
Idiot! Don't go runnin' your mouth off like that!

00:08:08.980 --> 00:08:10.750
Sorry...

00:08:14.190 --> 00:08:19.060
I go away for just a little while, and look at this place.
Has it turned into a funeral home?

00:08:27.600 --> 00:08:29.800
Hey, long time no see.

00:08:36.440 --> 00:08:38.010
I thought you bought it, man!

00:08:38.010 --> 00:08:40.450
I'd never do anything that stupid!

00:08:46.650 --> 00:08:48.760
Hi! Been a year, hasn't it?

00:08:48.760 --> 00:08:50.720
Have you grown any?

00:08:50.890 --> 00:08:53.030
Your hair sure did.

00:08:53.030 --> 00:08:55.120
You look more like a woman now...

00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:00.660
Ouch...

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:06.740
It might have been better for the
young lady if he'd just asked her,

00:09:06.740 --> 00:09:10.800
"Where is the treasure hidden?" straight off.

00:09:11.310 --> 00:09:14.820
He never gave it any serious thought,
and now things have gotten all complicated.

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:16.540
Yeah...

00:09:18.350 --> 00:09:20.390
Hey, don't worry about it!

00:09:20.390 --> 00:09:23.720
They had to get it out in the open sooner or later.

00:09:23.720 --> 00:09:27.630
Mister and Franca both understand that!

00:09:27.630 --> 00:09:30.360
I just hope it works out.

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:32.600
No kidding.

00:09:58.630 --> 00:10:00.530
You've gotten good at that.

00:10:10.840 --> 00:10:12.340
So you broke out.

00:10:12.340 --> 00:10:13.980
Yup...

00:10:13.980 --> 00:10:17.450
Even though you were almost done
serving your term.

00:10:17.450 --> 00:10:19.150
Yeah...

00:10:19.150 --> 00:10:20.880
Why'd you do it?

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:28.390
Forget I asked.

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:33.490
Soon Graceland will be gone,
and the treasure right along with it.

00:10:33.490 --> 00:10:36.430
You'll have to get me to spit out
where it's hidden quickly,

00:10:36.430 --> 00:10:39.230
or there will have been no point in you
taking care of me all this time.

00:10:39.230 --> 00:10:41.500
That's not true!

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:47.440
I was thinking I'd listen to your thoughts
before Graceland is blown away.

00:10:47.980 --> 00:10:49.340
MY thoughts?

00:10:49.340 --> 00:10:52.110
The reason the Guild killed your dad

00:10:52.110 --> 00:10:54.880
was because of something he left behind for you.

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:58.890
And I thought you'd want to know what it was.

00:10:58.890 --> 00:11:01.060
If you do, then I'll take you with me.

00:11:01.060 --> 00:11:02.750
That's a lie!

00:11:04.230 --> 00:11:07.830
All you want is to know where Papa left his legacy.

00:11:07.830 --> 00:11:11.920
I can't believe you'd lie and say
you were thinking of me!

00:11:19.310 --> 00:11:22.410
<i>Commence operation. All units spread out.</i>

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:23.900
<i>Roger.</i>

00:11:33.390 --> 00:11:36.790
This time, I will deliver him to you, Mother.

00:11:37.290 --> 00:11:40.860
You are Marciano's Twelve Sisters.

00:11:40.860 --> 00:11:44.330
I expect your actions to bring
no shame upon that name.

00:11:44.330 --> 00:11:46.630
<i>Yes, Mother.</i>

00:11:46.630 --> 00:11:48.340
<i>Hey, Mother.</i>

00:11:48.340 --> 00:11:51.240
<i>Why did you leave that girl alone?</i>

00:11:51.240 --> 00:11:55.240
<i>We could have just captured her and made
her say where the treasure was.</i>

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:57.210
<i>You've got it wrong.</i>

00:11:58.150 --> 00:12:03.120
<i>Mister could have forced her talk too.</i>

00:12:03.120 --> 00:12:07.250
<i>He must have some special reason
for not doing so.</i>

00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:10.250
<i>There must be some special reason
that we can't think of.</i>

00:12:10.760 --> 00:12:14.160
<i>That's another thing we'll find out
if we can catch him.</i>

00:12:17.770 --> 00:12:19.390
Bishop! Bishop!

00:12:20.370 --> 00:12:22.460
Damn it, are they jamming the frequency?

00:12:23.100 --> 00:12:26.400
Those Guild bastards oughta stop and think
what a pain this will be for the neighbors!

00:12:26.910 --> 00:12:29.570
You've got no place to be talking about
being a pain to people!

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:35.410
Mister!

00:12:37.150 --> 00:12:38.620
Heya!

00:12:46.390 --> 00:12:47.760
What?

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:51.100
It's been a while since you've called me that.

00:12:51.100 --> 00:12:53.230
"Mister," I mean.

00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:59.640
Go in there. I've got weapons in my room.

00:12:59.640 --> 00:13:00.270
All right!

00:13:14.190 --> 00:13:15.590
Over here!

00:13:19.790 --> 00:13:22.490
You're payin' me back with interest on this one!

00:13:23.500 --> 00:13:25.200
As the Coyotes say,

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:27.200
"Whatever you borrow,

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:29.470
don't give back, even if it means dying!"

00:13:30.140 --> 00:13:31.070
Ya got that right!

00:13:31.070 --> 00:13:34.910
Okay, I won't be stingy and say I'm lending it.
I'll give it to ya!

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:36.210
Now get going!

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:37.910
Thanks.

00:13:37.910 --> 00:13:40.350
I love you guys.

00:13:44.820 --> 00:13:46.690
Let's take 'em down, boys!

00:13:46.690 --> 00:13:47.980
Yeah!

00:13:50.830 --> 00:13:53.260
Damn it! The Guild beat us to him!

00:13:53.260 --> 00:13:55.260
Are the local police on the scene?

00:13:55.260 --> 00:13:58.830
Their reason for not moving is the chaos caused by
the communications interruption or something.

00:13:58.830 --> 00:14:01.170
They're probably being pressured
by some other party too.

00:14:01.170 --> 00:14:02.730
Who?

00:14:02.970 --> 00:14:05.740
I'd say it's either the governor of
Ku-Rong or the police.

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:08.620
The Guild is feeding bribes to someone, who in tum
wags his tail and obeys like a good dog.

00:14:08.620 --> 00:14:09.880
Ah, I see!

00:14:09.880 --> 00:14:11.150
It's nothing to be impressed about!

00:14:11.150 --> 00:14:14.980
Isn't there anything more to you than
a good memory and big boobs?!

00:14:14.980 --> 00:14:17.080
Please don't get mad at me!

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:19.650
After all, big boobs come in handy
every now and then.

00:14:19.650 --> 00:14:20.650
How?!

00:14:20.650 --> 00:14:24.360
They make it real easy to make friends at parties!

00:14:24.360 --> 00:14:27.190
Plus, people treat you to tasty
things to eat and stuff!

00:14:27.190 --> 00:14:30.860
Have some decency! Shameful!

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:37.370
Them's some nice boobs!

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:54.830
Damn! Not again!

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:55.370
This thing's falling apart!

00:14:58.090 --> 00:15:00.030
Why'd you come?

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:03.550
I figured I'd come hear your last words.

00:15:36.230 --> 00:15:39.470
The pendant that holds the secret to the treasure...

00:15:39.470 --> 00:15:40.730
Huh?

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:44.570
You could have taken it by force if you wanted.

00:15:44.570 --> 00:15:46.910
But you didn't.

00:15:46.910 --> 00:15:49.580
Because of me, you gave up flying
about throughout space...

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:52.610
and ended up making do by running a bar instead.

00:15:52.610 --> 00:15:55.780
I found it wasn't that bad a job once
I actually gave it a try, y'know.

00:15:55.780 --> 00:16:00.650
Behind a bar counter is not the kind of place
where someone can be a Coyote!

00:16:01.820 --> 00:16:05.780
Tell me, there's some secret reason
you couldn't do it, isn't there?

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:10.400
Well, no matter.

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:14.740
The way things are going, the treasure
will be space dust anyway.

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:18.010
You knew all about this pendant, didn't you?

00:16:18.010 --> 00:16:21.960
That the location of Papa's legacy
is hidden inside here.

00:16:25.410 --> 00:16:27.440
You can have it.

00:16:29.650 --> 00:16:31.180
I...

00:16:42.200 --> 00:16:44.320
Lemme rest a minute...

00:16:47.270 --> 00:16:49.040
Scratch that.

00:16:49.040 --> 00:16:50.770
Let's get a move on!

00:16:50.770 --> 00:16:52.000
This way!

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:20.470
<i>Target detected in abandoned
building at point A9.</i>

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:24.100
<i>Repeat: Target detected in abandoned
building at point A9.</i>

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:26.870
<i>Target is fleeing and heading
towards first floor exit.</i>

00:17:26.870 --> 00:17:30.240
<i>Surround the perimeter of the building at point A9.</i>

00:17:37.620 --> 00:17:38.880
Move in.

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:17.190
The transmitter was a diversion!
Target is not on the first floor!

00:18:19.790 --> 00:18:22.190
Damn! That was faster than I expected.

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:24.860
Whoa, hold on! We're too close!

00:18:35.480 --> 00:18:37.850
If you kill them, we'll lose it all!

00:18:37.850 --> 00:18:40.970
<i>I know. I will send out a recovery team immediately.</i>

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:44.910
Mother? Mother?!

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:46.980
What happened?

00:18:48.290 --> 00:18:49.190
What's the deal?

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:51.450
All of our communications lines are down!

00:18:56.500 --> 00:18:58.900
What the heck is this?!

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:05.470
This is...

00:19:05.570 --> 00:19:08.410
<i>No problemo, my busty little gal.</i>

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:12.070
You mean it? Thanks so much!

00:19:12.510 --> 00:19:15.040
One poison cures another.

00:19:15.280 --> 00:19:17.420
Hey, all you swank folk out there
in this dump of a town!

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:20.120
My name is Super Soul!

00:19:20.120 --> 00:19:24.530
I've hijacked the airwaves over this whole area.

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:26.890
So then! Tonight!

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:30.630
I'm bringing down the hammer on all those
dirty politicians who are in with the mob!

00:19:30.630 --> 00:19:31.600
Boobs!

00:19:53.590 --> 00:19:54.860
I'm gonna throw this up to you,

00:19:54.860 --> 00:19:57.520
so let go of me right when I do and catch it!

00:19:57.520 --> 00:19:58.660
Like hell!

00:19:58.660 --> 00:20:00.060
You idiot!

00:20:00.060 --> 00:20:03.050
You don't have to keep up this act anymore!

00:20:10.870 --> 00:20:12.400
Damn!

00:20:14.510 --> 00:20:17.380
You've been keeping it up for three years now...

00:20:17.380 --> 00:20:19.000
Enough is enough!

00:20:28.460 --> 00:20:31.660
Once you've found out the location of the treasure,

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:33.890
I'll have outlived my usefulness anyway!

00:20:37.600 --> 00:20:39.000
You've already done enough.

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:43.440
There's no need to pretend to
be kind to me anymore!

00:20:44.040 --> 00:20:48.030
You've been so, so kind to me already...

00:20:48.680 --> 00:20:51.980
It wasn't your damn pendant
I was keeping my eyes on!

00:20:51.980 --> 00:20:53.310
It was you!

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:02.320
Mister! Take the pendant!

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:03.920
Like hell!

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:14.700
We can't let them die!

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:18.470
Coyotes don't run in packs!

00:21:18.470 --> 00:21:19.510
But I'll tell ya...

00:21:19.510 --> 00:21:23.340
That's exactly why they won't betray their kin,
even if costs them their lives!

00:21:29.350 --> 00:21:30.350
Can you do it?

00:21:30.350 --> 00:21:32.680
Never underestimate Master Katana's technique!

00:21:37.890 --> 00:21:39.660
Let's go, Bishop!

00:21:39.660 --> 00:21:41.690
Leave this to me!

00:22:07.090 --> 00:22:08.710
Mister...

00:22:10.890 --> 00:22:12.790
Whew!

00:22:19.500 --> 00:22:22.300
You still haven't given me an answer.

00:22:22.470 --> 00:22:25.400
Do you want to see what your father left behind?

00:22:26.440 --> 00:22:29.000
You mind if we go together?

00:22:32.110 --> 00:22:33.510
Okay!

00:22:40.340 --> 00:22:44.520
<i>Where are these waterdrops...</i>

00:22:44.520 --> 00:22:54.840
<i>that travel along my cheek coming from?</i>

00:22:54.840 --> 00:23:00.400
<i>Tell me...</i>

00:23:01.380 --> 00:23:12.650
<i>I grabbed the rule that says we can't turn back time...</i>

00:23:12.650 --> 00:23:20.060
<i>by the collar.</i>

00:23:20.060 --> 00:23:23.800
<i>I resist the fading memories</i>

00:23:23.800 --> 00:23:34.440
<i>even with the feelings here</i>

00:23:34.440 --> 00:23:37.940
<i>But I'm sure they'll come to kill me</i>

00:23:37.940 --> 00:23:44.550
<i>From out of all the days that have gone by,</i>

00:23:44.550 --> 00:23:53.030
<i>there's only one thing I can believe in.</i>

00:23:53.030 --> 00:23:59.370
<i>I cried until my voice was hoarse</i>

00:23:59.370 --> 00:24:02.700
<i>Come to me</i>

00:24:02.700 --> 00:24:06.370
<i>Be by my side</i>

00:24:06.370 --> 00:24:10.000
<i>O Kay?</i>
